Program borrowings in September 2024, which were partially replaced with lower cost FHLB advances."}],"pretax":[{"heading":null,"text":"(1) Pre-tax, pre-provision earnings is calculated by adjusting income before income taxes for provision for (recovery of) credit losses."}],"tax":[{"heading":"Income Taxes","text":"Income tax expense increased $530 thousand or 22.8% to $2.9 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025 compared to $2.3 million for the six months ended June 30, 2024. Our effective tax rate for the six months ended June 30, 2025 stayed relatively unchanged at 22.4% compared to 22.3% for the same period ended June 30, 2024."}],"net":[{"heading":null,"text":"The Company reported net income of $9.9 million for the six months ended June 30, 2025, an increase of $1.8 million or 22.2% when compared to the six months ended June 30, 2024. Diluted earnings per common share were $0.69 for the six months ended June 30, 2025, compared to diluted earnings per common share of $0.57 for the six months ended June 30, 2024, representing a 21.0% increase."}]},"capex_src":{"concept":"us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment","label":"Purchases of bank premises and equipment","how":"xbrl"},"src":{"revenue":{"c":"us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax","l":"Revenue from Contract with Customer, Excluding Assessed Tax","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"pretax":{"c":"us-gaap:IncomeLossFromContinuingOperationsBeforeIncomeTaxesExtraordinaryItemsNoncontrollingInterest","l":"Income (Loss) from Continuing Operations before Income Taxes, Noncontrolling Interest","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"tax":{"c":"us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit","l":"Income Tax Expense","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ni":{"c":"us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss","l":"Net income","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"pl":{"c":"us-gaap:ProfitLoss","l":"Net income","ytd":true,"how":"xbrl"},"ocf":{"c":"us-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities","l":"Net Cash Provided by (Used in) Operating Activities","ytd":t